      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I recently offered to indicate the gender of the player and I was accused of sexism. You can be accused of racism ;-) .\nI think it is better to display the text \"EN\", \"FR\", and so on. If I don’t know what the text means, then I can quickly find it out on the Internet by entering it in a search query. If I don’t know the flag, then I’ll have to compare images of various flags for a very long time.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
